ormation\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nRecently a pull request added support for shadows in PopupMenus.\n\nIf I add a shadow, of say, 50 pixels to PopupMenu, it's items have a \"dead zone\" in the right side of them, i.e. when I click there, nothing happens.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a MenuBar\n2. Add a PopupMenu in it\n3. Add some items to it\n4. Override PopupMenu's Panel style, and add a 50px shadow for it\n5. Try to click the items from the right side\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n---","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103149/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}